WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the approved 77-second ARIA R4 commercial. Wording and timing come from the
audio-verified cue list (danceflow-aria-video/vertical/cues.json) and the locked script
(VOICEOVER_V4 F9, F11); times are on the R4 clock.

1
00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:03.300
Most business software keeps records.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.940
Most AI waits for you to ask a question.

3
00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:08.880
I don't.

4
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.210
I'm ARIA,

5
00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:13.460
the AI team member inside DanceFlow,

6
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.630
while you're focused on your business,

7
00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:19.450
keeping track of what needs attention across the operation.

8
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.070
A package running low,

9
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.630
a new inquiry that's gone quiet,

10
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.770
a class that's nearly full.

11
00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.550
I don't handle everything the same way.

12
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.630
You decide how I work.

13
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.010
Some things I can handle automatically.

14
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.130
Some wait for your approval.

15
00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.210
Others, I simply bring to your attention.

16
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.060
And when it comes to money,

17
00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:42.460
those decisions stay with you.

18
00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:46.330
Because DanceFlow isn't just software that keeps records.

19
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:50.100
It's an operating platform built to help do the work

20
00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:52.860
from the moment a dancer finds a studio,

21
00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.280
reaches out, and keeps coming back,

22
00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:59.610
DanceFlow connects the people and the work behind your business.

23
00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:05.800
Studios. Instructors. Organizers. Dancers.
One connected place.

24
00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:06.820
I'm ARIA,

25
00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:09.150
and I'm here to help you run it.

26
00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.200
DanceFlow.

27
00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:14.490
Software that helps do the work—
not just track it.
